{
  "name": "Oasis Chain",
  "stage": "Vents",
  "summary": "A wide, dark plain with five small vents far apart. Each vent is an oasis with food and a shelter; between them the water is cold and empty. The level is a chain of hops, and ATP is the clock.",
  "pillars": [
    "Distance is the hazard: the cold plain has no minerals, so a crossing must start with full pools.",
    "Each oasis is a small closed loop: feed, rest in the shelter, plan the next hop.",
    "Rock crescents shelter each vent on one side. The plume spills out of the open side, which points the way.",
    "Darkness is total between oases, so the player navigates by the glow of the next vent."
  ],
  "proposals": [
    "Marine snow: food that falls slowly from the top, the only food on the plain.",
    "Starvation pressure in creatures: drifting engulfers that get faster when hungry."
  ],
